Rāvaṇa enters splendid house to see Sītā --- Rāvaṇa finds Sītā grieving among Rākṣasīs --- Rāvaṇa shows Sītā mansions towers and ponds --- Rāvaṇa boasts lordship over dreadful Rākṣasas --- Rāvaṇa offers kingdom life and queenship to Sītā --- Rāvaṇa calls Rāma exiled powerless ascetic --- Rāvaṇa urges Sītā to enjoy Puṣpaka with him --- Rāvaṇa presses head at her feet as slave